"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619704_2267930567067491_8863090605884709555_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K7TmWqVfJm4Q7kNvwHw1Tsq&_nc_oc=Adq7-0MlReCoUTqxyq7SA0FBLl3bZ_zyB6rAsh08FXaetVIfD_PYH03Ifk3fiMgHVV8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx6ZZwn6PdE1Yu0TfUloyo8UtEoTObTRwHpcFnsUgqUtA&oe=69CE762E"}, "display_name": "Fit River XR : Rowing Cardio Meditation", "keywords": ["Rowing", "Workout", "Cardio", "Fitness", "Nature"], "long_description": "# Embrace the Flow. Fit River XR.\n\nTrade the gym for a serene river. Fit River XR is a mindful rowing experience with no rhythms\u2014just you, the water, and your paddle.\n\n**Your Workout, Your Time**\n\nSet your timer to fit your day:\n\n* **3 Mins :** Quick mental reset.\n* **5 Mins :** Relaxing flow.\n* **7 Mins :** Deep immersion.\n\n**Choose Your Atmosphere**\n\nPick scenery to match your mood:\n\n* **Morning:** Fresh mist.\n* **Evening:** Peaceful sunset.\n* **Night:** Moonlit stillness.\n\n**Real Results**\n\nEngage your core and arms with real rowing. Track distance and calories in real-time. Low-impact cardio that is rewarding for your soul.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n* **Scenic Focus:** Pure nature.\n* **Flexible Timers:** 3, 5, or 7 mins.\n* **Atmospheric Modes:** Morning, Evening, and Night.\n* **Stats:** Real-time distance and calorie tracking.\n\n**Find your flow today with Fit River XR .**\n", "short_description": "Fit River XR: Mindful VR Rowing Escape to serene rivers. A peaceful rowing experience with no forced rhythms\u2014just you and the water.\n\nFitness on Your Terms Set your timer and pick a session for your day:\n\n\u30fb3, 5, or 7 Minutes: Pick your duration.\n\u30fbAtmospheric Modes: Morning mist, Evening, or Night.\n\nReal Results Engage your core and arms with real rowing. Track distance and calories in real-time. Low impact, high reward.\n\nFind your flow with Fit River XR.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_pr